SizeMap.description:
Map a value  {@link  T }  to specific screen-size breakpoints.

Resolution follows a **mobile-first cascade**: the entry with the largest breakpoint that is ≤ the current viewport size wins.

```ts // Show "desktopCard" on md and above, nothing on xs/sm: { [ScreenSize.MD]: "desktopCard" }

// Show a different card per breakpoint: { [ScreenSize.XS]: "mobileCard", [ScreenSize.MD]: "desktopCard" }

// Explicitly hide on md and above: { [ScreenSize.XS]: "card", [ScreenSize.MD]: null } ```

Set `default` as a final fallback when no breakpoint entry matches.
